
================================================================
 CORTEX-M SECURITY POSTURE  (family: kinetis-fsec)
================================================================
 (1) IDENTITY
   SIM_SDID               0x12340680 (FAMILYID=0x1 SUBFAMID=0x2 SERIESID=0x3 PINID=0x0 REVID=0x0)
 (2) FLASH SECURITY (FTFE_FSEC)
   SEC (bits 1-0)         0x0 -> SECURED (debug-port access limited; unlock = mass-erase WIPE)
   MEEN (bits 5-4)        0b10 -> MASS-ERASE DISABLED — secured + no recovery (PERMANENTLY locked)
================================================================
 NOTE: reading any of the above proves the AHB-AP is OPEN -> internal flash is dumpable now.
================================================================
